{
  "_comment": "最老一代画布：工具栏只有一个「文字」总入口（group id = text），没有独立的标题 / 字形 / 对齐 / 列表分组，也没有图表分组。用户隐藏过 ruby、subscript、print、import，并把 view 组里的导出按钮挪到了最前。",
  "id": "legacy-text-single-entry",
  "type": "quadrant",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "theme": {
    "accentColor": "#2f6feb",
    "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
    "borderColor": "#e5e6eb",
    "fontFamily": "system",
    "position": "bottom-right",
    "textColor": "#1f2329",
    "watermarkOpacity": 0.08,
    "watermarkPosition": "bottom-right",
    "watermarkText": "内部资料"
  },
  "axes": {
    "x": { "label": "投入", "max": 100, "min": 0 },
    "y": { "label": "产出", "max": 100, "min": 0 }
